---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="XRP Robot Olympics" description="Winter Olympics-inspired robot competitions for Advanced Robotics">
  <main>
    <div class="hero" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e 0%, #3949ab 50%, #5c6bc0 100%); color: white; padding: 3rem 1rem; text-align: center;">
      <h1>🏆 XRP Robot Olympics</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Advanced Robotics Showcase | May 6, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <section class="intro">
      <p>
        Welcome to the Jahn Elementary XRP Robot Olympics! Our advanced robotics students have been 
        programming their XRP robots all semester, and now it's time to put their skills to the test 
        in a series of Winter Olympics-inspired competitions.
      </p>
      <p>
        Each team will compete in multiple events, earning points based on performance. May the best robots win!
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="events">
      <h2>🎯 The Events</h2>
      
      <div class="event-grid">
        <div class="event-card">
          <div class="event-icon">⛸️</div>
          <h3>Speed Skating</h3>
          <p>Race against the clock! Robots complete a full circle around the classroom as fast as possible. Fastest time wins.</p>
          <div class="skills">
            <span class="skill-tag">Speed</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Motor Control</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="event-card">
          <div class="event-icon">🛷</div>
          <h3>Skeleton</h3>
          <p>Navigate a maze course on paper with black tape — driver controlled! Guide your robot through without touching the walls.</p>
          <div class="skills">
            <span class="skill-tag">Driving</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Precision</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="event-card">
          <div class="event-icon">🎿</div>
          <h3>Luge</h3>
          <p>Same maze, but fully autonomous! Program your robot to follow the course using its light sensor. No human control allowed.</p>
          <div class="skills">
            <span class="skill-tag">Line Following</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Sensors</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="event-card">
          <div class="event-icon">🏒</div>
          <h3>Hockey</h3>
          <p>2v2 robot soccer on the FLL table! Work with a teammate to score goals while defending your own. Teamwork is key.</p>
          <div class="skills">
            <span class="skill-tag">Strategy</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Teamwork</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="event-card">
          <div class="event-icon">🥌</div>
          <h3>Curling</h3>
          <p>Push a small ball or disc onto a target. Closest to the center wins! Precision and gentle control are everything.</p>
          <div class="skills">
            <span class="skill-tag">Precision</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Control</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="event-card">
          <div class="event-icon">💃</div>
          <h3>Figure Skating</h3>
          <p>Dress up your robot and program a dance routine to music! Judged on creativity, choreography, and style.</p>
          <div class="skills">
            <span class="skill-tag">Creativity</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Programming</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="schedule">
      <h2>📅 Event Schedule</h2>
      <p>The Robot Olympics will take place during the Advanced Robotics Showcase on <strong>Tuesday, May 6, 2026</strong>.</p>
      <p>Family and friends are welcome to attend and cheer on the teams!</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-xrp">
      <h2>🤖 About XRP</h2>
      <p>
        The <a href="https://www.sparkfun.com/xrp" target="_blank">XRP (Experiential Robotics Platform)</a> is an 
        affordable, programmable robot designed for education. Our advanced students use Python to program 
        their XRPs, learning real-world coding skills while having fun with robotics.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="back-link">
      <a href="/classes/advanced-robotics">&larr; Back to Advanced Robotics</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1rem 2rem;
  }

  .hero {
    margin: 0 -1rem;
    border-radius: 0 0 1rem 1rem;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .intro {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  h2 {
    color: #1a237e;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #3949ab;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .event-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .event-card {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f5f5f5 0%, #ffffff 100%);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    border-left: 4px solid #3949ab;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .event-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .event-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .event-card h3 {
    color: #1a237e;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .event-card p {
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .skill-tag {
    background: #e8eaf6;
    color: #3949ab;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .schedule, .about-xrp {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .schedule h2, .about-xrp h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  a {
    color: #3949ab;
  }

  .back-link {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
  }

  .back-link a {
    color: #666;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .back-link a:hover {
    color: #3949ab;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
    
    .event-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
